{
  "name": "netease-163key-tagger",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "给本地音乐文件写入网易云音乐的 163key 标签，让客户端认成曲库里的歌",
  "main": "lib/163key.mjs",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "scan": "node apply.mjs scan",
    "dry-run": "node apply.mjs apply --dry-run",
    "apply": "node apply.mjs apply",
    "verify": "node apply.mjs verify",
    "self-test": "node apply.mjs self-test",
    "start": "node server.mjs",
    "web": "node server.mjs",
    "test": "node apply.mjs self-test",
    "build": "node build.mjs",
    "release": "pwsh -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File Build-Release.ps1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "postject": "^1.0.0-alpha.6"
  },
  "comment": "运行时零依赖：只用 Node 内置 crypto/fetch/fs。postject 只在打包单文件版时用，build.mjs 会自己装到 build-tmp。release 会一次产出「单文件版 + 安装版 + checksums.txt」，需要 PowerShell 7+（pwsh）和 Inno Setup 6/7（编安装包用）。"
}
